  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4f57265f2d95884493f924517248368, type: 3}
  m_Name: TreeSitter 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeText
  paragraphs:
  - I've been saving this place. In my head.
  - Haven't been here in a while, its different than I remember. More paths, more
    people.
  - 'The lake is always good though. '
  - 'Theres a bend in the river a bit further down with a green top hill looking
    over. '
  - Down there you can see a mess of junk or trash or something.
  - I think the bend and shape of the junk caught itself in the river.
  - I wonder where it came from...
